<BlogArticleShell
  title="Kakobuy Discord: giveaways, invite funnels, and verification habits | kakobuy-cn.com"
  description="Why Kakobuy Discord marketing exists, how raffles differ from wallet balances, and how to open Discord invites without handing chats your login."
  canonicalPath={canonicalPath}
  headline="Kakobuy Discord: drops, raffles, and keeping rumours separated from wallet facts"
